# Resource boundaries

Heavy work (Demucs) and bulky binaries (uploads) do not live on the Fly web VM.

- Vocal isolation already runs on the host Mac.
- User audio belongs in object storage (Tigris in prod), not the SQLite volume.
- The web process may coordinate and authorize; it is not the disk or the GPU.

Use Req for HTTP (including S3/Tigris SigV4). Do not add ExAws, HTTPoison, or Tesla.
